they'll pop up again and again from now on.

609
00:46:00,674 --> 00:46:03,084
もういっそ「一緒ランド」作りましょ
We might as well just create our "togetherland,"

610
00:46:05,974 --> 00:46:07,224
君とマッチアップ乗っかってって
hopping on this match-up with you.

611
00:46:07,764 --> 00:46:09,184
「構ってもっと足りないの」
"Gimme more attention. It's not enough."

612
00:46:09,184 --> 00:46:11,924
歌え思い出染み付いた嫉妬のstyle
Sing it—the style of jealousy steeped in memories.

